<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 13:30:07 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>卡塔尔的 Ooredoo、Nvidia 和诺基亚推出价值数十亿美元的人工智能计算平台——东南亚是他们的目标</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/qatar-ooredoo-nvidia-nokia-unveil-multi-billion-dollar-ai-compute-platformand-southeast-asia-is-their-target/</link><description>卡塔尔 Ooredoo 首席执行官在接受《财富》杂志独家采访时透露，为何东南亚是该公司从传统电信公司向领先数字基础设施提供商转型的下一个重要战场&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Ooredoo-CEO-e1785966877954.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:00:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/qatar-ooredoo-nvidia-nokia-unveil-multi-billion-dollar-ai-compute-platformand-southeast-asia-is-their-target/</guid></item><item><title>官员称卷心生菜与寄生虫病的关联已蔓延至 15 个州</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/iceberg-lettuce-link-to-parasitic-illness-spreads-to-15-states-officials-say/</link><description>密歇根州当地卫生官员胡安·路易斯·马克斯说：“联邦、地方、州等各级公共卫生部门都进行了人员削减。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286959593.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:56:34 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/iceberg-lettuce-link-to-parasitic-illness-spreads-to-15-states-officials-say/</guid></item><item><title>Lumen 将自己重塑为人工智能和企业背后的光纤网络——从 Anthropic 到 Yankees</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/lumen-reinvents-fiber-network-behind-ai-enterprise-anthropic-yankees-cfo/</link><description>Lumen 总裁兼首席财务官 Chris Stansbury 讨论公司的战略转型。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2242576246.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:33:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/lumen-reinvents-fiber-network-behind-ai-enterprise-anthropic-yankees-cfo/</guid></item><item><title>谷歌 DeepMind 首席人工智能官警告人工智能消灭人类的可能性“不为零”，但她不同意埃隆·马斯克的预测</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/google-deepmind-chief-ai-officer-statement-warning-ai-could-cause-human-extinction-odds-are-not-zero-disagrees-with-elon-musk/</link><description>埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 表示，到 2036 年，钱将不再重要；杰夫·贝佐斯 (Jeff Bezos) 表示，到 2045 年，我们将生活在太空中。谷歌 DeepMind 的莉拉·易卜拉欣 (Lila Ibrahim) 表示，实际上没有人知道这一点。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2246843877-e1785858998408.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/google-deepmind-chief-ai-officer-statement-warning-ai-could-cause-human-extinction-odds-are-not-zero-disagrees-with-elon-musk/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能不稳定的电力需求正在损害其自己的数据中心</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/ais-volatile-power-demand-is-damaging-its-own-data-centers/</link><description>与不稳定的人工智能训练负载相关的设备故障正在延迟项目并使电网紧张，引发罕见的三级监管警报。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288039036-e1786020456479.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:53:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/ais-volatile-power-demand-is-damaging-its-own-data-centers/</guid></item><item><title>五角大楼兵棋推演在伊朗袭击前几个月暴露了美国铝业的重大风险</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/pentagon-war-game-exposed-a-critical-u-s-aluminum-risk-months-before-iran-attacks/</link><description>伊朗无人机对阿联酋和巴林工厂的袭击将金属价格推至四年来的新高，由于军事库存不足，供应商面临压力。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2270377068-e1786019878252.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:52:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/pentagon-war-game-exposed-a-critical-u-s-aluminum-risk-months-before-iran-attacks/</guid></item><item><title>斯洛伐克的一个小镇今年第三次打破了自己的高温记录</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/slovakia-austria-heat-records-europe/</link><description>奥地利的卡梅尼察河畔赫罗诺姆 (Kamenica nad Hronom) 气温也达到了 41.4°C，创下了历史最高纪录——在这个夏季，欧洲的变暖速度是全球平均水平的两倍。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288126839-e1786020599320.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:51:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/slovakia-austria-heat-records-europe/</guid></item><item><title>康菲石油公司首席执行官瑞安·兰斯 (Ryan Lance) 在任职 14 年后辞职，由终身任职的首席财务官 (CFO) 接替</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/conocophillips-ceo-ryan-lance-steps-down/</link><description>Ryan Lance 是康菲石油公司自 2012 年从 Phillips 66 分拆以来的唯一首席执行官。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/GettyImages-1247860803.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:26:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/conocophillips-ceo-ryan-lance-steps-down/</guid></item><item><title>一位 86 岁的伐木者变身抗议者，为保护不列颠哥伦比亚省最后的老树而奋斗：“它几乎是光秃秃的”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/vancouver-island-old-growth-logging-standoff/</link><description>比尔·琼斯花了几十年的时间帮助拆除温哥华岛的旧经济增长。今天，他坐在路边阻止剩下的东西消失。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26215572034882-e1786020347108.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:46:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/vancouver-island-old-growth-logging-standoff/</guid></item><item><title>伊丽莎白·沃伦 (Elizabeth Warren) 要求回答有关国民警卫队部署的问题，并得出成本：14 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/national-guard-dc-1-4-billion-cost-georgia/</link><description>佐治亚州向华盛顿特区派遣的军队数量比华盛顿特区本身还多。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AP26196701142581-e1786020083391.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 12:41:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/06/national-guard-dc-1-4-billion-cost-georgia/</guid></item></channel></rss>